piano-sensors (5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Start adsprpcd-sensorspd as ready only once libssc finds the
    accelerometer, light, proximity and compass sensors (at most 60 s):
    the PD publishes them one by one after adsprpcd attaches, and
    iio-sensor-proxy, which looks each one up once, came up with the
    accelerometer only.

